{
  "id": "075",
  "title": "Buying Train Tickets",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2016-02-10",
  "synopsis": "Are you taking the train in China and need tickets? Unfortunately, in many places it is difficult to buy tickets using only English, so in this lesson we teach you some key Chinese phrases you can use.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/62/39972541279a698c2c20a029de816634dc208b09.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "买火车票\n\n    你好。我要买两张火车票。1张是3月1号从北京到上海的，时间越早越好。1张是3月6号下午从上海到北京的，价格越便宜越好。这是我的护照，谢谢！",
    "traditional": "買火車票\n\n    你好。我要買兩張火車票。1張是3月1號從北京到上海的，時間越早越好。1張是3月6號下午從上海到北京的，價格越便宜越好。這是我的護照，謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Buying Train Tickets"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "你好。我要买两张火车票。",
      "traditional": "你好。我要買兩張火車票。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo wǒ yào mǎi liǎng zhāng huǒ chē piào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "1张是3月1号从北京到上海的，时间越早越好。",
      "traditional": "1張是3月1號從北京到上海的，時間越早越好。",
      "pinyin": "1 zhāng shì 1 yuè 1 hào cóng běi jīng dào shàng hǎi de shí jiān yuè zǎo yuè hǎo",
      "english": "Hello, I would like to buy two train tickets."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "1张是3月6号下午从上海到北京的，价格越便宜越好。",
      "traditional": "1張是3月6號下午從上海到北京的，價格越便宜越好。",
      "pinyin": "1 zhāng shì 1 yuè 1 hào xià wǔ cóng shàng hǎi dào běi jīng de jià gé yuè pián yi yuè hǎo",
      "english": "One for March 1st, from Beijing to Shanghai. The earlier in the day the better."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "这是我的护照，谢谢！",
      "traditional": "這是我的護照，謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì wǒ de hù zhào xiè xie",
      "english": "One for March 6th in the afternoon, from Shanghai to Beijing. The cheaper the price the better."
    }
  ],
